@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Gui luot nop bai hop le -> 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200309",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/DTC245200309/EduSubmit"
}

### 4. Gui luot nop bai khong hop le (thieu thong tin) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 5. Tra cuu luot nop ton tai theo GUID -> 200 OK
# Su dung bien lay tu response cua request tao luot nop hop le o tren
@submissionId = {{createSubmission.response.body.id}}
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### 6. Tra cuu luot nop khong ton tai theo GUID -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

